{"id": "EUVD-2026-81770", "enisaUuid": "70ce5baf-e765-3e0c-8e17-9e736bc01efa", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nbpf: Check pointer type for all atomic RMW paths\n\nAtomic RMW verification records an instruction pointer type only when the\ncurrent destination is PTR_TO_ARENA. A second path can therefore reach the\nsame instruction with an ordinary pointer without comparing it against the\nsaved arena type.\n\nThe post-verification fixup uses the saved type to rewrite the instruction\nto BPF_PROBE_ATOMIC for every path. Record the actual destination type for\nall atomic RMW paths so the existing mismatch check rejects incompatible\nuses of one instruction.", "datePublished": "2026-09-17T16:07:03", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T12:50:19", "baseScore": 7.8, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H", "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b14dabe9656c1029abf3aa01e69c0d62f37f2f88", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d4ba9d888ac0a8f12c78071fff73e1205a0b9293", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/eb287c6e81dedef92da01eb947f380d0aae513c3", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4bc49ae344d65cfcef738f281ac575cf73ca2fc5"], "aliases": ["GHSA-mgh7-vvq6-r2vr", "CVE-2026-90177"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.16, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "08c1d23c-deb2-3ffb-8f77-5150f3ceed66", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.114"}, {"id": "1148f96e-dcdc-34ca-82e0-327a9211d1f7", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "1d9ccf88-7abd-3265-8e05-3ed7ef43d5bf", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "5cb1cdac-0984-33e3-a0d5-bf304120d393", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.6"}, {"id": "6b4106b6-04f2-3ab0-b0f7-3668c36fc44d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "d503a04f8bc0c75dc9db9452d8cc79d748afb752 <eb287c6e81dedef92da01eb947f380d0aae513c3"}, {"id": "b5a4dde9-1663-3652-b3ec-05010ed3e999", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "d503a04f8bc0c75dc9db9452d8cc79d748afb752 <4bc49ae344d65cfcef738f281ac575cf73ca2fc5"}, {"id": "d6e164c6-b8da-3c28-8b89-172980b0d576", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.10"}, {"id": "e1639fb9-4323-3d05-b04b-1dbb9755b174", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "d503a04f8bc0c75dc9db9452d8cc79d748afb752 <b14dabe9656c1029abf3aa01e69c0d62f37f2f88"}, {"id": "e60ff796-8339-3ab5-b760-6cc49339af45", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "d503a04f8bc0c75dc9db9452d8cc79d748afb752 <d4ba9d888ac0a8f12c78071fff73e1205a0b9293"}, {"id": "fd4d3f93-00d6-375e-bf3d-aa47da363115", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.57"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "d25b0495-64da-3ace-8ac4-963545a1f58b", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}